{
  "_source": "https://github.com/conorbronsdon/avoid-ai-writing (SKILL.md + detector/CATEGORIES.md), WebFetch-verified 2026-07-12. 53-category taxonomy. No JS engine installed (ruflo precedent) -- this is our own hand-built regex/substring checker over the same word/phrase lists.",
